The native log `/tmp/thegn-THE640-positive-native-20260915.log` has exactly 14 selector sections. Every section reports `running 1 test`, its requested test name followed by `... ok`, and `1 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 3384 filtered out`. There are no `FAILED`, panic, or timeout records. The receipt and log hashes agree (`0257d86269228718a90ee63a9223deb7dbff4b52babe246aa9792239e736c37b`).

